Thana: Sadar Bazar, Zila: Delhi
FIR No 231/2026    Dinank: 14-03-2026
Shikayatkarta: Sunita Devi w/o Ramesh Yadav, r/o H.No 45, Gali No 3, Paharganj, Delhi. Mob 9810055512
Ghatna ka sthan: Paharganj Main Bazar, Delhi
Ghatna: Meri beti Pooja ka mobile phone Samsung Galaxy 12 hazar rupaye ka chori ho gaya. Dinank 13 March 2026 ko sham 7 baje ek ladke ne bheed mein pocket se phone nikal liya. Aaropi ka naam Sonu urf Sonu Chikna bataya gaya hai jo Sadar Bazar ka rehne wala hai. Gawah Mukesh Kumar ne use bhagte hue dekha. Aaropi ke paas DL 8C AB 1234 number ki scooty thi.
Dhara 379, 411 IPC
Jaanch Adhikari: SI Rajesh Tomar
